  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、それは構わないけど\r\n……何かあったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005030180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200503/2022005030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005030190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "今日の撮影中、中学生のモデルの子に\r\n大人っぽくって羨ましいって言ったんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200503/2022005030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005030200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……そしたら、怒らせちゃったみたいで",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200503/2022005030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005030210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200503/2022005030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\nあのモデルの子、昔は子役で活躍してたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005030220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうなんですか……？\r\nすごい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200503/2022005030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、早いうちから背が伸びて\r\n子どもらしい役をやるのが難しくなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、モデルに転向したらしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005030230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200503/2022005030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あの子のことを小糸が羨ましく思うように\r\nあの子も、同じような気持ちを持っていたのかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005030240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200503/2022005030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005030250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ど、どうしようわたし……\r\nそんなこと、考えもしなくて……",
